OL,3,AFall in small boats down to law
OL,4,Aenforcement, agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw enforcement activity has been a
OL,7,F"key factor" in reducing the number of
OL,8,Fsmall boat Channel crossings, the
OL,9,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) says.
OL,11,FThe number of people arriving in the UK
OL,12,Fin the first half of 2026 was down 41%
OL,13,Fon the year before, government figures
OL,14,Fshow.
OL,16,FThe NCA said the drop followed a
OL,17,F"significant increase in arrests and
OL,18,Fseizures", although added "fluctuating
OL,19,Fdemand" for crossings, and the French
OL,20,Fauthorities preventing boat launches
OL,21,Fhad also played a role.
